{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>微軟的Outlook、Teams及Copilot等Microsoft 365服務大規模故障超過一日後，公司周六（14日）早上宣布已解決問題，各項服務應可正常使用。微軟就事件道歉，又說原因在於「網絡容量升級」時遇到技術故障，與網絡攻擊或人工智能（AI）無關。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T08:01:55.947463+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:18:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:43:21.478474+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:55:24.803719+00:00","content_hash":"739903b228515e3bb92d6b96eed0534be82841832f04443942e3e321f6f360e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}